--- STDOUT ---
Render PCB3D files for 3D visualization

Usage: pcb render [OPTIONS] [PATHS]...

Arguments:
  [PATHS]...  One or more .zen files to process for rendering. When omitted, all .zen files in the
              current directory tree are processed

Options:
  -o, --output <OUTPUT>  Output .pcb3d file path
      --no-open          Skip opening the output file after generation
      --offline          Disable network access (offline mode) - only use vendored dependencies
  -h, --help             Print help
